<title>UK: SOCCER-LEADING SCOTTISH PREMIER DIVISION SCORERS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LEADING SCOTTISH PREMIER DIVISION SCORERS.</headline>
<dateline>GLASGOW 1996-09-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading Scottish premier</p>
<p>division goalscorers after matches on Saturday:</p>
<p>6 - Pierre Van Hooydonk (Celtic), Billy Dodds (Aberdeen)</p>
<p>5 - Paul Gascgoine (Rangers)</p>
<p>4 - Jorge Cadete (Celtic), Ally McCoist (Rangers),</p>
<p>Peter Van Vossen (Rangers), Dean Windass (Aberdeen),</p>
<p>Andreas Thom (Celtic), Gary McSwegan (Dundee United),</p>
<p>Gerry Britton (Dunfermline)</p>
</text>
